  "name": "SSOJet",
  "abstract": "Enterprise SSO layer for B2B SaaS, built in the USA. Adds SAML and OIDC single sign-on to 100+ identity providers, SCIM directory sync, a self-serve IT admin portal and audit logs without replacing an existing login system such as Auth0, Firebase or Cognito. Also offers its own hosted login with passkeys, magic links, email and SMS codes, social login and MFA, organizations with RBAC, webhooks and M2M authentication. The Free plan has unlimited users and organizations but no SSO or SCIM connections; the Business plan is priced per connection, and Enterprise adds a dedicated private cloud and data residency. SaaS only.",
